# Local personal docs (not for public repo)
# Note the trailing /* rather than /: git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so the negation below would never fire against `docs/jesper's docs/`.
docs/jesper's docs/*
# Exception: the run checklist carries no credentials and has to survive to the
# next run. Everything else in that folder stays local — it holds a .env, and
# AZURE-AGENT-PROXY-README.md documents the credential-bearing proxy ignored
# above, including real tenant and client IDs. This repo is public.
!docs/jesper's docs/WPS-BENCHMARK-RUN-CHECKLIST.md

